* http://www.nethack.org/v341/bugs.html#C341-2

Put simply, if you leave bones while two-weaponing and it tries to
curse
your alternate weapon (roughly 80% chance), the game panic()s. One
rather annoying side effect is that the bones file does not get saved;
another is that you don't get a high score list entry (or even in the
logfile).

This happened to me a while ago, and I was rather disappointed since
it
happened to an ascendable character which died YASD and would've left
bones in minetown. I have since patched my version to fix that bug.

Dylan O'Donnel has written a simple patch to fix this problem; it can
be
found at the following URL:
* http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nh/c341-2.diff

